Do not ignore database and API complexity.
Do not count the same working hours twice.
Keep historical and future costs separate.
Keep operating expenses separate from development costs.
Keep statutory obligations separate from optional company benefits.
Do not hardcode statutory rates.
Verify Indian statutory requirements using official government sources.
